<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik up on bonus, warrant news.</title>
<headline>Vanik up on bonus, warrant news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of investment bank Vanik Incorporation Ltd rose five percent or 75 cents in early Friday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share rose on retail buying following the bonus and warrant announcement,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Vanik said it was issuing one bonus share for every four held, together with a warrant in the same proportion.</p>
<p>Warrant holders are entitled to buy a Vanik share at 25 rupees three years from the date of issue.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
